        "text_ijDWyG": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In 2012, Jenny’s life was forever changed when she became the adopted human to two Tibetan Terriers, Alfie and Belle, her \"furry children.\" This sparked the creation of Love My Human in 2018, a contemporary pet shop and refined grooming service. Her creative and conceptual mindset led her to expand the business further, and LMH Townhouse was born. Designed with the comfort and well-being of dogs at the forefront, LMH Townhouse offers a range of essential services for dogs, including a dog-friendly café, daycare, and wellness center. From a small team of four, Love My Human has grown into a dedicated and passionate team of 24 individuals, all driven by a shared love for dogs and a commitment to enriching the lives of both pets and their owners. Each team member plays a vital role in creating a welcoming, caring, and professional environment for our community.<br/><br/></p>",
